title: "Nicht-Physics & Empirical Inversions: Publication Series on 0-Consistency Physics and Apophatic Dynamics"
abstract: "A formal 0-consistency inversion of classical positive physics (1-logic), cognitive AI architectures, and socio-economic systems. Models fundamental interactions, operational limits (c, h, G), the Yang-Mills mass gap, non-equilibrium optimization, and non-perturbative boundary limits as scale-dependent friction limits (Wéi) and subtractive noise filtering against the invariant zero-baseline (B₀)."
